{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgvsc4wtct","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Benchmark LoCoMo/LongMemEval \"our way\": pre-learn conversations into the DAG at write time, then answer their QA probes over the DAG edge-read path — not retrieval-time RAG","summary":"Resolves the soundness concern that LoCoMo/LongMemEval are retrieval-time-recall benchmarks while Zonoid is write-time RAG materialized into the DAG (extends note-mqgu5ovs60x). The user rejected both \"beat the bar with retrieval-time RAG\" and \"benchmark only the search_knowledge fallback.\" Chosen METHODOLOGY (\"our way\"):\n\n(1) PRE-LEARN — ingest each benchmark conversation/session into the graph as nodes at WRITE time, running Zonoid's real materialization (autowire embed+cosine+cross-encoder + LLM edge-judge) so relevant memory freezes as context_deps edges, exactly as a normal task would.\n(2) PROBE OVER DAG — answer the benchmark's own QA probes using Zonoid's READ path (DAG edge traversal / get_dependency_summaries), NOT by bolting retrieval-time embed+cosine+rerank on top. Candidate mechanism: treat each QA probe as a node and let the same write-time edge materialization decide its context_deps (pre-retrieval), then answer from the inherited edges — so the score measures whether write-time-materialized context routing delivers the right memory to answer the probe. (Exact mechanism to be pinned down in design.)\n(3) SCORE vs the benchmark's gold answers; report next to the competitor bar (Mem0 LoCoMo 92.5 / LongMemEval 94.4; Zep 91.6 / 94.8). Arms: our-way DAG-read primary; optionally a search_knowledge retrieval-time arm + a cold/no-memory arm for contrast.\n\nDELIVERABLE NOW: set up the harness (adapter + probe runner + scoring + report), mirroring the existing SWE-Bench-CL Zonoid memory adapter (task 9195fb5e-f196-497d-962f-69616733d2e9/19). PUBLIC FRAMING: present LoCoMo/LongMemEval as a CONTRAST axis (retrieval-time recall) and report Zonoid's number as \"their test, our architecture\" — not a head-to-head concession that recall is the metric. Holding the register attempt (commit 874a547, task .../1) UNMERGED so the sound framing + the our-way number land together via the harness feature, rather than publishing the head-to-head \"competitor bar\" framing first.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T16:53:19.856Z","vec":[-0.10579134523868561,0.026327194646000862,-0.04034317657351494,0.053894028067588806,-0.02841988392174244,-0.06610693037509918,-0.029872657731175423,0.08386208862066269,-0.007761332672089338,0.005306323990225792,-0.059293489903211594,0.025181017816066742,0.03132617846131325,0.005419773980975151,-0.028203539550304413,0.01918681152164936,0.10883487015962601,0.06200241670012474,-0.049797240644693375,-0.01950269378721714,0.10272648930549622,-0.01702002063393593,0.05428694933652878,-0.06996454298496246,0.017922423779964447,-0.008164624683558941,-0.07681573927402496,0.05379829928278923,0.047138188034296036,-0.049213819205760956,0.05259128659963608,0.11614450067281723,-0.032408706843853,0.03835354000329971,-0.08587469160556793,0.07237758487462997,-0.01761501096189022,-0.060214024037122726,-0.014252705499529839,-0.03606141731142998,0.01878977008163929,0.14255978167057037,-0.02284303307533264,0.022455940023064613,0.07688857614994049,-0.02892244979739189,-0.06177579611539841,0.019554603844881058,-0.07156386971473694,-0.029828296974301338,-0.12752173840999603,0.005170413292944431,-0.04409485310316086,0.092283695936203,-0.011160554364323616,0.1087343767285347,0.021390685811638832,0.03853319585323334,-0.05398740619421005,0.021443139761686325,-0.014347310177981853,-0.09480850398540497,-0.06203058734536171,-0.015279612503945827,0.0523444227874279,-0.018630100414156914,0.06844321638345718,-0.02447343058884144,0.014740499667823315,-0.009834599681198597,-0.011776704341173172,0.009599481709301472,-0.03558337688446045,0.029508283361792564,-0.008294069208204746,0.08565372228622437,0.059254638850688934,0.0003817261604126543,-0.011750565841794014,-0